andled with this approach:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\n# a.gd\r\nclass_name A\r\n\r\nclass Inner:\r\n   pass\r\n\r\n# b.gd\r\nclass_name B\r\nextends A.Inner\r\n\r\nclass Inner:\r\n    pass\r\n\r\n```","created_at":"2026-06-13T19:34:37Z","updated_at":"2026-06-13T19:34:38Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106256#discussion_r3408499384","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106256","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3408499384"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106256#discussion_r3408499384"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106256"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3408499384/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":347,"original_start_line":347,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":348,"original_line":348,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":3248266284,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":7,"position":7,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3408536408","pull_request_review_id":4491972035,"id":3408536408,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7LKiNY","diff_hunk":"@@ -344,13 +344,13 @@ void GDScriptDocGen::_generate_docs(GDScript *p_script, const GDP::ClassNode *p_\n \tdoc.script_path = p_script->get_script_path();\n \n \tif (p_script->base.is_valid() && p_script->base->is_valid()) {\n-\t\tif (!p_script->base->doc.name.is_empty()) {\n-\t\t\tdoc.inherits = p_script->base->doc.name;\n+\t\tif (p_script->base->local_name != StringName()) {\n+\t\t\tdoc.inherits = p_script->base->local_name;","path":"modules/gdscript/editor/gdscript_docgen.cpp","commit_id":"29be69b302a5567a719ecee5a05e68d609af367c","original_commit_id":"29be69b302a5567a719ecee5a05e68d609af367c","user":{"login":"Cykyrios","id":53737317,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNzM3MzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53737317?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios","html_url":"https://github.com/Cykyrios","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"True, this PR breaks your example (I would consider inheriting an inner class poor architecture, but that's not the point here). I'm still of the mind that expecting a script's documentation to be generated to know which class it inherits from is a problem, especially when the editor and doctool don't load scripts in the same order, and therefore have different behaviors in the master branch.\r\n\r\nShould we investigate around dalexeev's [comment](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106256#discussion_r2083402155) from last year instead? Again, the editor and doctool have different script-loading behaviors, the MRP works properly with doctool while the editor fails to get the full inheritance tree, but at least one of my projects has both failing.","created_at":"2026-06-13T20:04:19Z","updated_at":"2026-06-13T20:04:19Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106256#discussion_r3408536408","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106256","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3408536408"},"html":{"href":"https://gi